ARC or PLC in Pike County","/arc-plc/illinois/pike-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Pike County record runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 25% of normal in January to February and 31% in August to September. Grid 23555 had its driest year in 1953 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
